    <string name="about_history_text">Simple-Notes (GPL-3.0) was my favorite FOSS notes app until the project was sold to a shady Israeli company named ZipoApps in 2023. I forked it to keep it alive, FOSS and updated. I will release new versions as long as I have time and energy. Code contributions on Github are very welcome :)</string>
